        '20411',
        'BI reports - Study',
        'Kindly note that we need your support in the following points:    -YTD average:  Please add the YTD average per customers to the “facilities” & “deposits” BI reports, the calculation should follow the same method used in the attached file “YTD average calculation”.   noting that “year to date avg balance” option is available in BI under the path (Account analysis – Measures - Aggregated (Sum)), but we were unable to test it as we couldn’t add the option to our reports.    -Foreign Accounts adjustments:  The current “Monthly avg. balance” for foreign accounts needs to be modified to convert the MTD average to its equivalent amount in JOD, even if the same exchange rate applicable is the last date of the month rate and as clarified in the attached file “Foreign accounts adjustment”.  The same method to be followed in the YTD average.  We appreciate your support in working with us in order to resolve these issues by the end of this month as we need to include it as part of our reporting based on the management requirement.',
