        'Issue in Suspected Customers Screen',
        'Dear Team,  We would like to report an issue identified in the Suspected Customers screen for Level 2 users.  Currently, managers (Level 2) are expected to view only alerts with the status “Sent for Approval” for each customer on this screen. However, we have observed that alerts with both “Sent for Approval” and “Approved” statuses are appearing for managers, which does not align with the intended behavior.  As an example, this issue can be observed for Customer Number 815264937, as shown in the attached image.',
