        'New Customer screening Issue',
        'Dear Feryal ,  Good morning    Please be informed that an observation has been identified regarding the screening mechanism for new customers. The screening process is not being performed as required, where new customers are supposed to be screened periodically three times per day on the same day the relationship is initiated.  It has been noted that the system is instead screening customer names that were entered on a previous date (one day earlier). For example, on the screening date 23/12, all new customers registered on 22/12 were screened once, in a single batch. The remaining two scheduled screenings for new customers were recorded as zero, as no actual screening was performed on the same day.  Please note that this procedure has been verified, and it was found that this practice has been occurring for more than one day. As of today, 24/12, new customers registered on 23/12 have still not been screened, including customers who opened their accounts between 9:00 AM and 7:00 PM on 23/12 and have not yet been screened , despite the fact that the screening was conducted twice during this period .    Accordingly, the periodic screening process for new customers (three times per day) is ineffective when applied in this manner, as new customers are not screened at the time of onboarding, but rather are screened collectively the following day in a single batch.    We kindly request that this matter be reviewed and addressed to ensure compliance with the required screening procedures.  Thank you for your cooperation.',
